[[File:Map of Washington highlighting Pierce County.svg|thumb|Location of Pierce County in Washington]]

This is intended to be a complete list of the properties and districts on the '''[[National Register of Historic Places]]''' in [[Pierce County, Washington|Pierce County]], [[Washington (state)|Washington]], [[United States]]. Latitude and longitude coordinates are provided for many National Register properties and districts; these locations may be seen together in an online map.<ref>{{NRHPGoogleMapFootnote}}</ref>

There are 193 properties and districts listed on the National Register in the county. 97 of these properties and districts are located in the city of [[Tacoma, Washington|Tacoma]], while the remaining 96 properties and districts are listed separately. Another 2 properties were once listed but have been removed.

{{NRHP date for lists|Washington}}
{{GeoGroup}}{{Clear}}

==Pierce County (exclusive of Tacoma)==
