|date=1987-07-15
|image=Alderton School.jpg
|lat=47.170036
|lon=-122.228619
|description=Along with a separate gymnasium, Alderton School was constructed in 1915. The brick buildings were last used as a school facility in 1958. The schoolhouse was partially demolished in 2026.<ref name="111YO">{{cite news |last1=Bsanti |first1=Puneet |title=111-year-old Pierce County landmark demolished after permit 'issued in error' |url=https://www.thenewstribune.com/news/local/community/puyallup-herald/ph-news/article315804138.html#storylink=latest_side |access-date=May 20, 2026 |work=[[The News Tribune]] |date=May 21, 2026}}</ref>
}}
